{
  "id": "neo-summer-road-2001-best-in-japan",
  "name": "Neo Summer Road 2001 Best in Japan",
  "category": "event",
  "description": {
    "text": "The Battle★Neo Summer Road Best in Japan deciding match, the national final of the summer 2001 circuit, held at Makuhari Messe in Chiba on 25 August 2001 in a junior and a senior division. The junior winners were also invited to the second day of the 2001 International Tropical Mega Battle in Hawaii on 26 August, so they flew out straight afterwards.\n\nThe top three of each division won a cosmos holo No. 1, No. 2 or No. 3 Trainer card with the winner's own photograph and name in place of a drawn trainer, in front of Ho-Oh, the circuit's emblem, and the Battle★Neo Summer Road logo; the cards credit the photographs to Takumi Akabane. Only one of each was made. Where a winner shows in our pictures, we've blurred their name and face.",
    "sources": [
      {
